### Salud de la API
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Listar planetas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/planets

### Obtener un planeta
GET http://localhost:3000/api/planets/earth

### Crear un planeta (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/planets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kepler-186f",
  "type": "terrestrial",
  "massEarths": 1.4,
  "distanceFromSunAu": 500,
  "habitable": true,
  "description": "Un mundo rocoso que orbita en una zona potencialmente habitable."
}

### Validación fallida (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/planets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "X",
  "type": "unknown",
  "massEarths": -1,
  "distanceFromSunAu": -4,
  "habitable": "yes",
  "description": "corto"
}

### Actualizar un planeta (200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/planets/mars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Marte renovado",
  "type": "terrestrial",
  "massEarths": 0.107,
  "distanceFromSunAu": 1.524,
  "habitable": false,
  "description": "El planeta rojo, actualizado para el atlas orbital."
}

### Eliminar un planeta (204)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/planets/mars

### Recurso inexistente (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/planets/no-existe